OL,3,CMan charged with murder of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman in Athens remanded in custody
OL,6,FA 26-year-old man charged with the
OL,7,Fmurder of a Scottish woman in Athens
OL,8,Fhas been remanded in custody.
OL,10,FSharif Ahmadzai, an Afghan boxer who
OL,11,Fhas legally lived in Greece for 10
OL,12,Fyears, exercised his right to remain
OL,13,Fsilent during a hearing on Thursday
OL,14,Fmorning.
OL,16,FHe is accused of killing Elisabeth-
OL,17,FJane Ross, 38, who was discovered in a
OL,18,Fsuitcase in a derelict building in the
OL,19,FKypseli area of the Greek capital on
OL,20,FJuly 18.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
