OL,3,CMan charged with murder of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman in Athens remanded in custody
OL,6,FAhmadzai arrived at the Court of First
OL,7,FInstance in Athens at about 10:40am
OL,8,Flocal time, in the back of a grey
OL,9,FHyundai car with blacked-out windows.
OL,11,FThe court complex is located on the
OL,12,Fcity's Evelpidon Street, a short walk
OL,13,Ffrom where the charity worker's body
OL,14,Fwas found.
OL,16,FAhmadzai also faces robbery and
OL,17,Fviolation of weapon laws charges.
OL,19,FGreek officials said he admitted
OL,20,Fmoving the body but has denied the
OL,21,Fmurder allegations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/3
